+<h2 id="oct19-delta">October 19, 2026 &mdash; focused delta audit</h2>
+<p>This pass compares selected active projects against <a href="https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/commit/2eb0d37629215491bfc31ea57cdce5630d4f1450"><code>RiptOPL rebuild/main@2eb0d376</code></a> (checked October 19 UTC). It is <b>not</b> a full rescan of every project in the A–Z directory. Git history/code and README capabilities are separate from physical console test evidence.</p>
