+<tr><td><b>No longer missing</b></td><td>CF1–CF3</td><td><a href="https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/pull/955">RiptOPL #955</a> integrates PC CARD CF menu/in-game paths. <a href="pc-card-cf.html">Hardware acceptance is still pending</a>. Companion file-manager work CF4 is separate.</td></tr>
+<tr><td><b>No longer missing</b></td><td>U1</td><td><a href="https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/blob/rebuild/main/docs/PARENTAL-LOCK.md">Per-game parental lock</a> is implemented and host-tested, with real-console UI validation remaining.</td></tr>
+<tr><td><b>New source deltas</b></td><td>LU12–LU14</td><td><a href="https://github.com/dnunezx/LUNA/compare/475f7b2513e739cf63af9cd4ed8c84280e93a762...9c5be408df787000a7e650f66f0a43411060e1d7">LUNA gained 40 commits</a> since the last pinned comparison, including PS1 disc-set/swap control, save-card tools and expanded file management.</td></tr>
