+<h2 id="caduceus-companion">Caduceus &amp; Caduceus OPL versus PS2-Servers &amp; RiptOPL</h2>
+<h3 id="caduceus-gaps">Verified Caduceus gaps: CA1–CA7 and CO1–CO7</h3>
+<p><b>14 source-specific entries, not 14 unrelated feature concepts.</b> These include seven missing PC companion capabilities and seven console UI, integration or behavior differences. CO3 overlaps existing OR4; CO1 and CO7 are optional design choices; CO4 is experimental and not equivalent to a validated physical-console feature.</p>
+<table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Feature</th><th>Evidence and actual gap</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody>
