+<h2 id="audit-oct15-b">October 15 follow-up: desktop library, virtual SMB and visual OPL derivatives</h2>
+<p>A focused code comparison against <a href="https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/tree/rebuild/main">RiptOPL</a> and <a href="https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/PS2-Servers">PS2-Servers</a> identified five additional <em>source-attributed differences</em>. These are not five shipping commitments or five verified console improvements. The source snapshots and corresponding branches are pinned in <a href="#audit-revisions">Revision and validation scope</a>. Previous Caduceus, OPLattice, RIPPS2, OPHTML and HTTP/UDPFS records remain separate; overlaps are called out below.</p>
