+<h3 id="orbit-manager-audit">OrbitPS2 Manager (desktop)</h3>
+<p><a href="https://github.com/Luden02/OrbitPS2-Manager">Luden02/OrbitPS2-Manager</a> is an Electron/Angular desktop library manager for Windows, macOS and Linux. It can import and catalog PS1/PS2 titles, download artwork, edit per-game CFG and manage VMC files. Those generic workflows overlap existing <a href="#caduceus-companion">Caduceus CA entries</a> and <a href="https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/PS2-Servers/blob/main/launcher/game_library.py">PS2-Servers' SQLite library/import tools</a>; the two entries here deliberately track more specific operations.</p>
+<table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Difference</th><th>Comparison and validation</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody>
+<tr><td><code>OM1</code></td><td><b>Bidirectional PS1 launcher-layout migration</b></td><td>OrbitPS2 imports CUE/BIN/ZIP to VCD and can convert an installed PS1 library between POPStarter-style <code>XX./SB.</code> launcher apps and direct <code>POPS/</code>/<code>VCD/</code> RiptOPL/POPSLoader layout, including a library-wide action. PS2-Servers has PS1 VCD catalog/hash support, but no equivalent confirmed <em>bidirectional bulk launcher-layout conversion</em>. Preserve artwork by VCD filename in any future integration; never overwrite source VCDs or remove a working launcher before a verified replacement exists.</td><td><a href="https://github.com/Luden02/OrbitPS2-Manager/blob/cb915ca62d650a298fd951ec781ea3d39cf1f8cf/src/services/rename.service.ts">rename/convert service</a> · <a href="https://github.com/Luden02/OrbitPS2-Manager/blob/cb915ca62d650a298fd951ec781ea3d39cf1f8cf/src/services/ps1-import.service.ts">PS1 import modes</a></td></tr>
+<tr><td><code>OM2</code></td><td><b>Batch ISO/ZSO file transformation</b></td><td>Local worker-pool ISO → block-indexed LZ4/ZSO conversion, batch compression and reverse per-file ZSO → ISO. This differs from <em>playing or streaming</em> compressed files (RiptOPL and PS2-Servers already do that). Generic queued imports and cover downloads overlap Caduceus CA2/CA3 or existing tools; the missing component is a desktop <em>transformation</em> workflow. Only import tested output, preserve originals by default and compare performance, filesystem limits and image integrity.</td><td><a href="https://github.com/Luden02/OrbitPS2-Manager/blob/cb915ca62d650a298fd951ec781ea3d39cf1f8cf/src/services/zso.service.ts">ZSO worker-backed conversion</a></td></tr>
+</tbody></table>
