+<li><b>October 15, 2026 status reconciliation:</b> OR3 (RA Neutrino), OR4/CO3 (console achievement browser), CO5 (paired Caduceus gating) and CO6 (SMB ECHO refresh) are implemented in RiptOPL and now marked as such in the searchable register. LU6 has improved Favorites staging but is not identical to LUNA's entire temp-file design. U9 is a closed, unmerged upstream experiment. These stable IDs remain in the historical ledger and source counts.</li>
