+<li><b>Focused October 15, 2026 source additions:</b> added PS2CF (CF1–CF4; <a href="https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/pull/955">RiptOPL #955</a> / <a href="https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Launchstation/pull/156">Launchstation #156</a>), OPL-DualSense-BT (DB1–DB2), RIPPS2 (RI1–RI4), Enhanced PS2 Disc Launcher (DL1–DL2), and OPL FUTURE (OF1). Also recorded PS2-SNL, PS2BBL Extended and non-native launcher candidates without inflating the counted gaps. The previous source-wide audit remains dated October 8; this is a focused supplement, not a complete re-audit of every previously tracked repository.</li>
