+          "message": "docs(ilink): both i.LINK driver builds now carry the #1018 fix\n\n#1022 (OPL's IEEE1394_bd, also shipped in the bundled Neutrino) and #1024\n(POPSTARTER's usbhdfsd.irx.ilink) were each written while the other was\nopen, so ORIGIN.txt and NEUTRINO.md still said POPSTARTER's pair was not\npatched, and the README credited only POPSTARTER's driver and called the\nnative OPL path \"still under investigation\". Say that all three cores'\ndrivers have the change, still not confirmed on hardware.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
