+          "message": "test(lang): Mode 8 labels stay right after their predecessor, later labels may follow\n\ntest_accurate_read_rate.py required MODE8/HINT_MODE8 to be the file's last two\nlabels, so appending BDMA_ERR_OLD after them (the append-only rule) failed it.\nCheck the positional contract instead: they directly follow\nVMC_PFS_LIMIT_ON_CREATE, as when they were added.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
