+      "body": "## Fixed\n\n- Mode 6 (in-game reset off) no longer stops the achievements. The per-frame snapshot ran only from the IGR's VBLANK handler, so a game set to Mode 6 sent nothing to the PC. The loader now installs a handler with the snapshot alone in that mode: no IGR thread, no padOpen patch, no syscall hooks. Sly Cooper and the Thievius Raccoonus, which takes the IGR for tampering and hides its collectibles, runs clean under Mode 6 with its achievements (#15). Checked on hardware from an SMB share.\n\n## Known limits\n\n- RESET CONSOLE from the client needs the IGR, so it does nothing under Mode 6.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/hacan359/xerabora/compare/v0.1.0-alpha.16...v0.1.0-alpha.17\n\n",
