+      "body": "## Improved\n\n- The client's page is redrawn. A plain theme in place of the pixel one, a layout that fits a phone, and a look that follows the source: while the console streams the page turns gold and the cover spins as a disc that stumbles on lost packets; while following an emulator it turns blue.\n- Library cards and the game head show two progress bars, softcore and hardcore, with the award in the corner of the cover.\n- An achievement can be hidden from UP NEXT. The next one by median takes its slot, and \"N hidden · SHOW ALL\" brings them back.\n- The page is now written in pieces under `client/ui/src` on Preact, and `tools/build-page.py` assembles, embeds and rebuilds the demo.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/hacan359/xerabora/compare/v0.1.0-alpha.11...v0.1.0-alpha.12\n\n"
