+          "message": "Build 106: POWER OFF in the in-game menu; the star on the left and keys for the list's row icons\n\nThe in-game menu's last choice turns the PS2 off, on a second press as\nEXIT GAME leaves (a disc game keeps the ROM's power button and says so).\nA starred game's star now sits left by default, in its own column, with\nSettings > Game Sources > Starred Games Star (Theme, Left, Right, Hidden);\na theme's row icon moves to the row's end when the star is on the left.\nNew ItemsList keys: star, star_image, highlight (bar, line, none),\ndecorator_all and decorator_ps2 / _ps1 / _app. Translated in every language.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
