+          "message": "Build 108: found while making the reel (the info page knows a game, new shots show at once, PNGs checked)\n\nThe reel takes found four things before release. A device rescan rebuilds the\ngame list under an open info page, and the info group, the slideshow, the shot\nshow and the art fades keyed on the row's address, so all the page's art faded\nin again: they key on the game's id and title now. After Auto developed shots,\nthe art cache still held its earlier \"absent\" answers, so the info page showed\nnone: developing ART re-opens them. Once, an ART PNG reached the drive with an\nempty directory entry and held its number: each developed PNG's size on the\ndrive is compared with what was written, with one more try, and an empty file\ncounts as a free number. SCRn finds the shots in order, _SCR first, whatever\norder the reads come back in, and shows only a shot known to be there.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
