+        "patch": "@@ -38,6 +38,7 @@ strings:\n   Show GameID Barcode (Pixel FX): 显示 GameID 条码（Pixel FX）\n   Sixth: 第六\n   Starred Games Page Start Mode: 收藏游戏页面启动方式\n+  Starred Games Star: 收藏游戏的星标\n   Third: 第三\n   VCD Games List Settings: VCD 游戏列表设置\n   3 x 2 Large: 3 x 2 大\n@@ -56,6 +57,7 @@ strings:\n   Full: 完全\n   Hidden: 隐藏\n   Launch Disc First: 光盘优先\n+  Left: 左\n   Memory Files First: 文件优先\n   'No': 否\n   None: 无\n@@ -67,6 +69,7 @@ strings:\n   Pop In: 弹出\n   REBOOT IOP?: 重启 IOP？\n   RIPPS2 %s (build %d) on RiptOPL %s: RIPPS2 %s（构建 %d），基于 RiptOPL %s\n+  Right: 右\n   Same as Grid Layout: 与网格布局相同\n   Shown: 显示\n   Spin: 旋转\n@@ -474,6 +477,53 @@ strings:\n   'The copy stopped: the disc could not be read or the drive could not take more. Nothing was kept.': 复制已停止：光盘无法读取或驱动器无法再写入。未保留任何内容。\n   ? This audio CD's table of contents could not be read. Clean the disc, close the tray again and try once more. (TYPE %02X, TOC\n   : 无法读取这张音乐 CD 的目录。请清洁光盘，重新关上托盘再试一次。（类型 %02X，TOC\n+  '%s OF %s   %d%%': '%s / %s   %d%%'\n+  '%s is already there. Replace it?': '%s 已存在。要替换吗？'\n+  '%u MB': '%u MB'\n+  '%u.%02u GB': '%u.%02u GB'\n+  A BIN and CUE for Ember, in the PS1 games list.: 供 Ember 使用的 BIN 和 CUE，在 PS1 游戏列表中。\n+  A FOLDER YOU PICK IN MEMORY FILES: 在记忆文件中选择的文件夹\n+  A game rips to a USB drive, the exFAT HDD, MX4SIO or iLink, and none is started. Connect one, then open Storage once.: 游戏会提取到 U 盘、exFAT 硬盘、MX4SIO 或 iLink，但都没有启动。请连接一个，然后打开一次存储。\n+  A memory card is far too small for a disc. Paste it on a USB drive, the HDD or an MMCE card.: 记忆卡太小，放不下一张光盘。请粘贴到 U 盘、硬盘或 MMCE 卡上。\n+  ABOUT %d H %02d MIN: 约 %d 小时 %02d 分钟\n+  ABOUT %d H %02d MIN LEFT: 剩余约 %d 小时 %02d 分钟\n+  ABOUT %d MIN: 约 %d 分钟\n+  ABOUT %d MIN LEFT: 剩余约 %d 分钟\n+  ADD THIS GAME TO YOUR STORAGE: 将此游戏加入存储\n+  ADD THIS MEDIA TO YOUR FILES: 将此媒体加入你的文件\n+  ANOTHER DRIVE: 其他驱动器\n+  AUDIO CD   %d TRACKS   %u:%02u: 音乐 CD   %d 首   %u:%02u\n+  CONFIRM: 确认\n+  DRIVE: 驱动器\n+  DVD VIDEO: DVD 视频\n+  HDD (exFAT): 硬盘（exFAT）\n+  HOLD: 按住\n+  LESS THAN A MINUTE LEFT: 剩余不到一分钟\n+  Media rips to a USB drive, the HDD or an MMCE card, and none is started. Connect one, then open Storage once.: 媒体会提取到 U 盘、硬盘或 MMCE 卡，但都没有启动。请连接一个，然后打开一次存储。\n+  'Only a DVD video you made yourself: a bought film is copy protected, and the drive will not read it.': 仅限你自己制作的 DVD 视频：购买的电影有防复制保护，光驱不会读取。\n+  'Over 4 GB: saved as 1 GB parts with ul.cfg, as Open PS2 Loader does, since a FAT32 drive holds 4 GB a file.': 超过 4 GB：像 Open PS2 Loader 一样以 1 GB 分段并配合 ul.cfg 保存，因为 FAT32 驱动器每个文件最多 4 GB。\n+  PS1 GAME: PS1 游戏\n+  PS2 GAME: PS2 游戏\n+  READING THE DISC: 正在读取光盘\n+  READY: 就绪\n+  RIPDISC could not read what is on the disc. Clean it, put it back and try again.: RIPDISC 无法读取光盘内容。请清洁光盘，重新放入后再试。\n+  RIPDISC found no VIDEO_TS folder it can read on this DVD.: RIPDISC 在这张 DVD 上找不到可读取的 VIDEO_TS 文件夹。\n+  RIPPS2 cannot read this game's ID, which its 1 GB parts are named by. Rip it to the internal exFAT HDD instead.: RIPPS2 无法读取这款游戏的 ID，而 1 GB 分段要用它命名。请改为提取到内置 exFAT 硬盘。\n+  Ripped as %d parts of 1 GB with ul.cfg on the drive. It is in your games list.: 已在驱动器上提取为 %d 个 1 GB 分段并配合 ul.cfg。它已在你的游戏列表中。\n+  Ripped to %s as a BIN and CUE. It is in the PS1 games list, played with Ember.: 已作为 BIN 和 CUE 提取到 %s。它在 PS1 游戏列表中，用 Ember 运行。\n+  Ripped to %s. It is in your games list.: 已提取到 %s。它已在你的游戏列表中。\n+  SIZE: 大小\n+  Stop the rip? What it has written so far is removed.: 要停止提取吗？已写入的内容将被删除。\n+  TIME: 时间\n+  TO: 位置\n+  The disc in the drive is not the one on the clipboard. Hold SELECT on LAUNCH DISC again.: 光驱中的光盘不是剪贴板上的那张。请在启动光盘页面再次按住 SELECT。\n+  'The rip stopped: the drive could not take more. Check it has room and is not write protected. Nothing was kept.': 提取已停止：驱动器无法再写入。请确认它有空间且未写保护。没有保留任何内容。\n+  ? 'The rip stopped: the drive would not read the disc. A bought DVD film is copy protected and cannot be ripped; a scratched or dirty disc can also stop it. Nothing was kept.'\n+  : 提取已停止：光驱无法读取光盘。购买的 DVD 电影有防复制保护，无法提取；有划痕或脏污的光盘也可能使其停止。没有保留任何内容。\n+  'The rip stopped: the drive would not read the disc. Clean it, put it back and try again. Nothing was kept.': 提取已停止：光驱无法读取光盘。请清洁光盘，重新放入后再试。没有保留任何内容。\n+  This game is already on the drive as split parts. Delete it in Storage first to rip it again.: 这款游戏已以分段形式在驱动器上。请先在存储中删除它，再重新提取。\n+  USB DRIVE: U 盘\n+  iLINK DRIVE: iLINK 驱动器\n   ASPECT: 画面比例\n   CHOOSE: 选择\n   CLEAR: 清空\n@@ -515,6 +565,7 @@ strings:\n   : 这个游戏通过 Neutrino 启动，而 RIPPS2 查找的位置（设置、游戏所在驱动器、记忆卡）都没有 Neutrino。RIPPS2 附带 rickgaiser 的 Neutrino 1.8.0（AFL-3.0）。现在安装吗？接下来选择位置。\n   '%d / %d FILES': '%d / %d 个文件'\n   '%d FOLDERS AND CONTENTS': '%d 个文件夹及内容'\n+  '%d FOLDERS, %d FOUND': '%d 个文件夹，找到 %d 个'\n   '%s BYTES': '%s 字节'\n   '%s does not look like a text file. Open it in the text editor anyway?': '%s 看起来不像文本文件。仍要在文本编辑器中打开吗？'\n   '%u KB FREE%s': 剩余 %u KB%s\n@@ -542,7 +593,6 @@ strings:\n   DELETE WHOLE SAVES HERE: 删除此处的整个存档\n   DELETED: 已删除\n   DONE: 完成\n-  DRIVE: 驱动器\n   DRIVES STARTED: 驱动器已启动\n   Delete %d items?: 删除 %d 个项目？\n   Delete %s?: 删除 %s？\n@@ -563,20 +613,17 @@ strings:\n   FULL: 已满\n   HDD (APA PARTITIONS): 硬盘（APA 分区）\n   HDD (OPL HOME): 硬盘（OPL 文件夹）\n-  HDD (exFAT): 硬盘（exFAT）\n   HDD MANAGER: 硬盘管理器\n   HEIGHT: 高度\n   HIGH: 高\n   IN / OUT: 进 / 出\n   IN USE: 使用中\n-  INSTALLER: 安装器\n   IS ALREADY HERE (%d MORE TO GO). REPLACE IT?: 已存在（还剩 %d 个）。替换吗？\n   IS ALREADY HERE. REPLACE IT?: 已存在。替换吗？\n   KEEP IT: 保留\n   LOW: 低\n   MARK: 标记\n   MARK ALL: 全部标记\n-  MC EXPLOIT: 记忆卡漏洞\n   MEMORY CARD %c: 记忆卡 %c\n   MEMORY FILES SETTINGS: 记忆文件设置\n   MODIFIED  %s: 修改于  %s\n@@ -593,8 +640,7 @@ strings:\n   NOT CONNECTED: 未连接\n   NOT EMPTY: 不为空\n   NOT FOUND: 未找到\n-  ? No installer found. Put your memory card exploit installer ELF (FreeMcBoot, OpenTuna, wLaunchELF R3Z...) in APPS on a memory card or USB drive, then choose this again.\n-  : 未找到安装器。请把记忆卡漏洞安装器的 ELF（FreeMcBoot、OpenTuna、wLaunchELF R3Z……）放到记忆卡或 U 盘的 APPS 中，然后再选这一项。\n+  Nothing named \"%s\" on the drives listed. START DRIVES in the drive list starts the rest.: 列出的驱动器上没有名为“%s”的内容。驱动器列表中的“启动驱动器”可启动其余驱动器。\n   'OFF': 关\n   ONE FORMATION STAYS IN: 至少保留一个阵列\n   OPEN: 打开\n@@ -624,17 +670,22 @@ strings:\n   RENAME FAILED: 重命名失败\n   RENAMED: 已重命名\n   RIP 3D ICON: 提取 3D 图标\n+  RIPPED: 已提取\n   RUN: 运行\n   Reading the disc image: 正在读取光盘镜像\n   Ripping the icon: 正在提取图标\n   Run %s?: 运行 %s？\n+  SEARCH: 搜索\n+  'SEARCH: %s   %d FOUND': 搜索：%s   找到 %d 个\n+  SEARCHING: 正在搜索\n   SELECT: 选择\n   SETTINGS: 设置\n   SLOW: 慢\n   SPEED: 速度\n   START DRIVES: 启动驱动器\n   STARTING...: 正在启动...\n   Starting this drive's games: 正在启动此驱动器的游戏\n+  Stopped before anything named \"%s\" was found.: 在找到名为“%s”的内容之前已停止。\n   TEXT: 文本\n   The icon is in %s/ as OBJ (one for each shape), MTL and PNG.: 图标位于 %s/，为 OBJ（每个形状一个）、MTL 和 PNG。\n   This disc image has no PS2 boot file (SYSTEM.CNF), so it cannot start.: 这个光盘镜像没有 PS2 启动文件（SYSTEM.CNF），因此无法启动。\n@@ -646,19 +697,16 @@ strings:\n   UNPACK PSU HERE: 在此解包 PSU\n   UNPACKED: 已解包\n   UNPACKING: 正在解包\n-  USB DRIVE: U 盘\n   USB, HDD, MMCE, AND MORE: USB、硬盘、MMCE 等\n   Unpack the save %s %s?: 解包存档 %s 到%s？\n   WITH L2: 配合 L2\n   WRITE: 写入\n   YES TO ALL: 全部是\n   YES, REPLACE IT: 是，替换\n-  iLINK DRIVE: iLINK 驱动器\n   into this folder: 此文件夹\n   onto this memory card: 此记忆卡\n   '%d PARTITIONS   %s FREE OF %s': '%d 个分区   剩余 %s / 共 %s'\n   '%s IS IN USE: TRY AGAIN': '%s 正在使用：请重试'\n-  '%u MB': '%u MB'\n   '%u.%u GB': '%u.%u GB'\n   COULD NOT REMOVE %s (%d): 无法删除 %s（%d）\n   HDL GAME: HDL 游戏\n@@ -848,7 +896,6 @@ strings:\n   'CD WITH 1 SOUND TRACK: START LASER PLAYS IT': 含 1 首音轨的 CD：按 START 用光驱播放\n   DISC READ: 读取光盘\n   DOUBLE HELIX: 双螺旋\n-  DVD VIDEO: DVD 视频\n   'ESR DISC: A PATCHED PS2 GAME': ESR 光盘：打过补丁的 PS2 游戏\n   GOLDEN SPIRAL: 黄金螺线\n   ICOSAHEDRON: 二十面体\n@@ -857,11 +904,8 @@ strings:\n   LISSAJOUS: 利萨如图形\n   MOBIUS STRIP: 莫比乌斯带\n   No disc RIPPS2 can start is in the drive. Insert a PS1 or PS2 game, a DVD video or an ESR disc, then press Start.: 光驱中没有 RIPPS2 能启动的光盘。请放入 PS1 或 PS2 游戏、DVD 视频或 ESR 光盘，然后按 Start。\n-  PS1 GAME: PS1 游戏\n-  PS2 GAME: PS2 游戏\n   PS2 GAME   %s: PS2 游戏   %s\n   PS2 GAME   %s   %s: PS2 游戏   %s   %s\n-  READING THE DISC: 正在读取光盘\n   SEVEN-POINT STAR: 七角星\n   START BROWSER: START 浏览器\n   START LASER: START 光驱\n@@ -883,6 +927,47 @@ strings:\n   COPY AND START: 复制并启动\n   Copying %s: 正在复制 %s\n   LAUNCH ANYWAY: 仍然启动\n+  '%d NOT SAVED: DRIVE FULL': '%d 张未保存：驱动器已满'\n+  '%d OF 6': '%d / 6'\n+  '%d ROLLS': '%d 卷胶卷'\n+  '%d SHOTS': '%d 张'\n+  '%d SHOTS ON THE ROLL': 胶卷上有 %d 张\n+  '%d SHOTS SAVED': 已保存 %d 张\n+  1 ROLL: 1 卷胶卷\n+  1 SHOT: 1 张\n+  1 SHOT ON THE ROLL: 胶卷上有 1 张\n+  1 SHOT SAVED: 已保存 1 张\n+  Auto: 自动\n+  BOTH: 两者\n+  DEVELOP: 冲洗\n+  DEVELOP ALL: 全部冲洗\n+  DEVELOPING %d OF %d: 正在冲洗 %d / %d\n+  Delete this shot?: 删除这张照片？\n+  'L1+L2+R1+R2+SELECT+START pauses the game: resume, exit, take a screenshot, check achievements or power off.': L1+L2+R1+R2+SELECT+START 暂停游戏：继续、退出、截图、查看成就或关机。\n+  Manual: 手动\n+  NO SHOTS WAITING: 没有等待的照片\n+  No SCREENSHOT in the in-game menu, and no space kept for it.: 游戏内菜单中没有 SCREENSHOT，也不为它预留空间。\n+  'On': 开\n+  SHOT %d: 照片 %d\n+  ? Screenshots from the in-game menu, to ART for your themes or to MEDIA. 6 per game; each game with shots waiting holds 4 MB.\n+  : 从游戏内菜单截图，存到供主题使用的 ART 或 MEDIA。每个游戏 6 张；每个有等待照片的游戏占用 4 MB。\n+  Shots turn into PNGs by themselves once you are back in RIPPS2, in the background while you browse.: 回到 RIPPS2 后，照片会在你浏览时于后台自动变成 PNG。\n+  Shots wait on each game's roll in Memory Files (MEDIA/RIPSHOT) until you develop them. Nothing runs on its own.: 照片在记忆文件 (MEDIA/RIPSHOT) 中各游戏的胶卷上等待，直到你冲洗它们。不会自动运行任何操作。\n+  The combo leaves the game at once, as before.: 组合键像以前一样立即退出游戏。\n+  VIEW: 查看\n+  Memory Card: 记忆卡\n+  Internal HDD: 内置硬盘\n+  Custom Path: 自定义路径\n+  Settings go in RIPPS2's own save on a memory card (the one RIPPS2 started from first), as before.: 设置存入记忆卡上 RIPPS2 自己的存档（先存到启动 RIPPS2 的那张卡），和以前一样。\n+  Settings go in a RIPPS2 folder on the internal HDD (exFAT, or the APA HDD's OPL partition) and are read from there first.: 设置存入内置硬盘（exFAT，或 APA 硬盘的 OPL 分区）上的 RIPPS2 文件夹，并优先从那里读取。\n+  Settings go in the folder typed below, e.g. mass0:/OPL.: 设置存入下面输入的文件夹，例如 mass0:/OPL。\n+  'NO INTERNAL HDD FOUND: SETTINGS STAY WHERE THEY ARE': 未找到内置硬盘：设置保持原位\n+  USB Drive: USB 驱动器\n+  Settings go in a RIPPS2 folder on the USB drive and are read from there first.: 设置存入 USB 驱动器上的 RIPPS2 文件夹，并优先从那里读取。\n+  Settings go in a RIPPS2 folder on the MX4SIO card and are read from there first.: 设置存入 MX4SIO 卡上的 RIPPS2 文件夹，并优先从那里读取。\n+  Settings go in a RIPPS2 folder on the iLink drive and are read from there first.: 设置存入 iLink 驱动器上的 RIPPS2 文件夹，并优先从那里读取。\n+  Settings go in a RIPPS2 folder on the MMCE card and are read from there first.: 设置存入 MMCE 卡上的 RIPPS2 文件夹，并优先从那里读取。\n+  'THAT DRIVE IS NOT CONNECTED: SETTINGS STAY WHERE THEY ARE': 该驱动器未连接：设置保持原位\n labels:\n   MTAP_ENABLE: 多分插模拟\n   HINT_PADEMU_WORKAROUND: 部分仿制 DS3 需要变通处理，此选项会启用它。\n@@ -1022,7 +1107,7 @@ labels:\n   RIPPS2_PAGE_BUTTONS: 翻页按键\n   HINT_RIPPS2_PAGE_BUTTONS: 用哪对肩键翻游戏列表的页。L2 / R2：它们翻页，L1 / R1 切换分类。L1 / R1：它们翻页，L2 / R2 切换分类。主题：由主题决定；没有主题时 L2 到开头，R2 到结尾。同时按 L2 + R2 始终选择随机游戏。\n   RIPPS2_IGR_MENU: 游戏内菜单\n-  HINT_RIPPS2_IGR_MENU: 实验性。开启：L1+L2+R1+R2+SELECT+START 暂停游戏并显示 继续、成就 和 退出游戏；某些游戏在过场动画中暂停会出现声音跳跃或游戏停止。关闭（默认）：组合键立即退出游戏，即 OPL 可靠的 IGR。\n+  HINT_RIPPS2_IGR_MENU: 开：L1+L2+R1+R2+SELECT+START 暂停游戏：继续、退出、截图、查看成就或关机。关：组合键像以前一样立即退出游戏。\n   RIPPS2_BOOT_LOADER: 引导程序\n   HINT_RIPPS2_BOOT_LOADER: 显示每张记忆卡开机时启动的内容，并安装 BIBLE（为 RIPPS2 设置的 PS2BBL）。记忆卡原有的启动文件会保留。\n   RIPPS2_MANAGE: 管理\n@@ -1057,6 +1142,7 @@ labels:\n   RIPPS2_HINTS_GLYPHS: 提示与图标\n   HINT_RIPPS2_HINTS_GLYPHS: 按键提示和图标的样式。每一行都从“主题”开始，即主题的选择；你的任何其他选择都优先于所有主题。\n   RIPPS2_HINT_LAYOUT: 提示布局\n+  HINT_RIPPS2_STARSIDE: 收藏游戏的星标在列表中的位置。左：每行开头单独一列。右：标题之后。隐藏：不显示星标。主题：按主题设定。主题的行图标会移到另一端，两者不会重叠。\n   HINT_RIPPS2_HINT_LAYOUT: 横排：所有提示排成一行。竖列：每行一个提示，在一侧排成列表，从主题放提示的位置开始。\n   RIPPS2_HINT_LABELS: 提示文字\n   HINT_RIPPS2_HINT_LABELS: “仅图标”只画按键，适合自带文字的图标。“徽章”把每个提示的图标和名称合在一个徽章上。\n@@ -1291,3 +1377,10 @@ labels:\n   PCCF_UNAVAILABLE: CF 不可用：需要带 PC CARD 的早期日版 PS2、兼容的卡，并且没有已启用的 DEV9/硬盘/网络驱动。\n   PCCF_UNSUPPORTED_GAME: CF 目前只支持原生 PS2 游戏。CF 上的 VMC、PS1 加载和网络成就不可用。\n   HINT_ENABLE_DVR: 实验性的 DESR DVR ISO 发现。需要开启硬盘来源；启动游戏需要外部支持 DVR 的 Neutrino。\n+  HINT_RIPPS2_IGR_PAGE: 游戏内菜单、RIPSHOT 以及照片如何冲洗。\n+  RIPPS2_RIPSHOT: RIPSHOT\n+  HINT_RIPPS2_RIPSHOT: 从游戏内菜单截图，存到供主题使用的 ART 或 MEDIA。\n+  RIPPS2_DEVELOP_SHOTS: 冲洗照片\n+  HINT_RIPPS2_DEVELOP_SHOTS: 各游戏胶卷上等待的照片如何变成 PNG。\n+  RIPPS2_SETTINGS_HOME: 设置保存到\n+  HINT_RIPPS2_SETTINGS_HOME: RIPPS2 存放设置的位置：记忆卡上它自己的存档、驱动器（内置硬盘、USB、MX4SIO、iLink 或 MMCE）上的 RIPPS2 文件夹，或你输入的文件夹。"
