+          "message": "test(ilink): simulate the post-reset login hold and unready drives\n\ntest_ilink_bd_reset.py compiles initConfigureSBP2Device (extracted) and\nall of scsi.c (mini variant) against simulated drives and a simulated\nclock: logins refused for 1, 1.6 and 4.5 s, a drive that never lets go,\nslow refusals, TEST UNIT READY never ready or ready after 50 polls,\nfailed INQUIRY / READ CAPACITY, block length 0, and slot reuse after\nfailures. The SDK sources fail 12 of the checks; wired into flavours.yml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
