+        "message": "End what the update helper's publish leaves running\n\nThe 0.17.0 release's export waited 15 minutes after it had finished: MSVC's\nlinker, run by the helper's Native AOT publish, leaves vctip.exe (its\ntelemetry uploader) running, and it held Godot's output pipe, which the\nconsole wrapper waits on. Local exports hung the same way.\n\nPlatform/ToolProcess runs the publish in a job object of its own and ends\nwhatever it left running as it exits; the export addon uses it.\n\nGenerated with Claude Code under company AI usage policy",
