+        },
+        "message": "Rescan the library without its media folders\n\nSettings, Library has two rescans. \"Rescan the library\" (F5, and the scans\nat launch) lists every ROM folder, and a system's media folder only when it\nfinds a game the library didn't have, so an unchanged library lists no media\nfolder; \"Rescan the library and media\" (Shift+F5) is the old full scan, for\nfiles put in the media folder by hand. LibraryService.RescanAsync takes a\nRescanMedia; a media folder change and saved ROM folders still index every\nmedia folder they affect.\n\nodyssey-scrape scan --quick and the nav-script step quick-rescan run it.\ncore-bench: an unchanged rescan with media 110.5 ms, the quick one 61.5 ms.\n\nGenerated with Claude Code under company AI usage policy",
