+        "message": "Check for updates in the settings\n\nSettings, Odyssey Launcher, Check for updates asks GitHub for the newest\nrelease; a newer one is offered in a question, and yes downloads it beside\nthe launcher, checks its SHA-256 and unpacks it, then quits. OdysseyUpdater.exe,\na Native AOT helper shipped beside the launcher (published by the export\naddon), waits for the launcher to quit, renames the new files into place\n(putting the old version back if any rename fails), keeps the user's files,\nand starts the launcher again with the same command line.\n\n--update-feed and --open=update test it from a local folder.\n\nGenerated with Claude Code under company AI usage policy",
