+        "message": "An in-app theme downloader, as ES-DE's\n\nSettings, Look, Download themes lists the themes on GeekRhapsody/odyssey-themes\n(themes.json and screenshots, a git repository cloned into the cache and\nfetched when the page opens) and gets, updates and removes them as git clones\nin ConfigDir/themes/<id>/ through LibGit2Sharp. Each entry pins the commit the\nowner tested. Nothing loads or goes online at boot.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
