+        "message": "Grids no longer fade items at the top and bottom of the screen\n\nThe item shader faded items near the screen's top and bottom into the\nbackground gradient's colour, so over a bright background the rows under\nthe overlay washed out to that colour instead of darkening. The fade is\ngone (edge_fade, ItemGrid.FadeAtEdges, and the inspected cell's exemption\nin its per-cell data); only the overlay's dark scrims lie over them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
