+        "message": "Themes set the focused item's sway and the others' bob\n\n[motion] focus_sway and idle_bob (A6 Motion): multiples of the launcher's\nown motion, 0 to 3, each the theme's else the base's else 1. The sway\nscales ItemGrid.FocusTransform's angle; the bob is the item shader's\nidle_bob uniform, set on a grid's materials only when it isn't 1. Both\ngrids and a system's details follow the theme, at boot and on a switch.\n\nBenched before and after on the export (docs/perf/theme-motion.md): no\nchange in start-up, scroll frame times, GPU time, allocation or memory.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
