+        "message": "Themes set their menus' colours and font; Slab goes dark grey\n\nA theme's [ui.menu] sets the menus' background, text, accent and font\n(A6 Menus). Setting no colour keeps the launcher's own palette exactly\n(MenuPalette.Legacy); setting any derives every menu colour from the\nthree. UiStyle.Apply recolours the shared styles in place, with the\nGodot Theme silent until all its boxes have changed, and maps the\ncolours the menus shown copied, so a switch applies with the settings\nopen. A font loads on a worker (at most 4 MB) and its ASCII is drawn\nahead at the menus' main sizes.\n\nSlab's background is now black to dark grey, and its menus dark grey\nwith a light grey focus. Scrolling is unchanged; a palette switch costs\none 18-20 ms frame (docs/perf/menus.md).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
