+        "message": "Wait for background work calling into Godot when quitting\n\nA quit while the theme's models were still converting on the thread pool\ncrashed the process in Godot's interop (17 of 24 early-quit captures).\nBoot/GodotWork counts work that calls into Godot: new work is refused once\nthe app quits, and Main._ExitTree waits up to 5 s for the rest. Model\nconversions, the boot's media arrays, thumbnails, the match panel's covers\nand both video threads go through it (replacing the card video's own wait).\nAfter: none of 24, waiting 14-203 ms.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
