+        "message": "Favourites and Recently played cards: a Power Star and the Dreamcast clock\n\nThemes can now give Favourites and Recently played cards of their own\n([systems.favourites] and [systems.recently_played] model), resolved like\na system's card; the default card stays their fallback. The console theme\nuses it: Super Mario 64's Power Star (its focused clip opens its eyes,\nhops, spins and wiggles) and the Dreamcast settings menu's alarm clock\n(its focused clip bounces, rings and leaps), built by\ntools/console-models/power_star.py and alarm_clock.py with the shared\nclip.py. Also ignores __pycache__ and untracks a committed .pyc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
