+<h2 id="xerabora">xeRAbora</h2>
+<p>RiptOPL's RA build now follows upstream <a href="https://github.com/hacan359/xerabora/releases/tag/v0.1.0-alpha.15">xeRAbora alpha.15</a>. <a href="https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/pull/881">PR #881</a> implemented the larger watch sets and cadence (retired H2) and alignment-safe bounded reads (retired H3). H1 pointer chains were already present. H1–H3 reflect earlier parity; H4–H10 now record alpha.18 and companion differences in the inclusive inventory. RA with Neutrino remains the separate <a href="#orbit">OR3</a> capability. Successful host tests and target builds do not establish console interoperability. See <a href="retroachievements.html">RetroAchievements</a> for the paired client and validation scope.</p>
