+<a href="https://github.com/Rian6/caduceus-opl/tree/cc1713a893a976c9b26ae1dd9975c200a461edfe"><code>caduceus-opl/main@cc1713a8</code></a> (console gitlink <a href="https://github.com/Rian6/caduceus-opl/tree/2a98a9d7361f8e33f421244bc88c318eab3bdf2f"><code>opl-snapshot@2a98a9d7</code></a>),
+<a href="https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/PS2-Servers/tree/c1eb1e5aecd9e8359dc5b7799fc7f135a81f51d5"><code>PS2-Servers/main@c1eb1e5a</code></a>, and
+<a href="https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/tree/7452341a076d3e7a5e14e613429c7eca594f4888"><code>RiptOPL/rebuild/main@7452341a</code></a>.
+Seven CA-series and seven CO-series source-attributed gaps are now listed, including optional and experimental distinctions. Console achievement browsing overlaps <a href="#orbit">OR4</a>, PC game-aware Discord presence goes beyond <a href="#upstream-prs">U6</a>, and RiptOPL already has an in-game RA unlock overlay. Source/release evidence is not universal physical-PS2 validation.</div>
