+        "body": "## Downloads\n\n| Version | ZIP | PSU |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Standard | [Download](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Launchstation/releases/download/latest/APP_LAUNCHSTATION.zip) | [Download](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Launchstation/releases/download/latest/APP_LAUNCHSTATION.psu) |\n| DS34 USB/Bluetooth controllers | [Download](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Launchstation/releases/download/latest/APP_LAUNCHSTATION-DS.zip) | [Download](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Launchstation/releases/download/latest/APP_LAUNCHSTATION-DS.psu) |\n\nExtract the ZIP and launch its ELF, or install the PSU with **PSU Paste**.\nExisting user settings are retained. The built-in updater preserves your controller version.\n\n## Changelog\n\n- **Safer file replacement:** an existing destination is retained until its replacement has been written and checked. Failed publication rolls back; recovery files survive interrupted operations.\n- **Copy failure details:** compact stage/error, device, byte-count and build information make failed transfers diagnosable. A failed source-folder listing is no longer reported as an empty successful copy.\n- **Cross-device copying:** positive short reads and writes complete the remaining bytes. Slot-2 card preparation happens before opening source files when leaving MX4SIO.\n- **Clearer file operations:** the dashboard shows the filename, remaining megabytes and a progress bar while copying, with progress updates during deletion and verification.\n- **Consistent storage names:** Home and the application library use MASS labels for mass-storage applications.\n- **Software clock:** setting a time now offers to save it immediately and waits for verified storage completion. Save current clock retains later runtime. The clock resumes the saved checkpoint after restart; elapsed time while unplugged is unavailable.\n- **Storage loading:** returned mount waits redraw more frequently while retaining the existing device discovery windows. MMCE returns each probed port's bus state to the normal card/controller drivers.\n- **Power-off:** setup starts only the power-off service, without loading unused DEV9 drivers, and detects failed initialization.\n\n[Full changelog](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Launchstation/compare/59bb62017283d6d4c8c06082246116d07f541dd4...593f16dc808f203d3d10638c16462eb1eb0c40e8) · [Documentation](https://nathanneurotic.github.io/Launchstation/)\n\nDevice and display behavior still require console validation; a passing build does not establish hardware compatibility.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Build verification and SHA-256 checksums</summary>\n\nBuilt from [593f16d](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Launchstation/tree/593f16dc808f203d3d10638c16462eb1eb0c40e8). [Build checks](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Launchstation/actions/runs/39433439957) passed:\nhost regressions, documentation, standard/DS34 builds, controller variants,\nloader memory layout and app-package verification. Published packages are downloaded and compared with the build outputs before the rolling tag moves.\n\n```text\n31ac93f1a53abcc501e8e8a6846ac5e271543a9d61eb9db67e6a64c58aa989ac  APP_LAUNCHSTATION.zip\nf09e2ba28c1b830904857929604bb94eb12f15eb05ff9b8afd6eeab9fdb743db  APP_LAUNCHSTATION.psu\na2a4308e2e92b198ee5a01b4a32ab395d057f87d1f5274e50f9b3fef6462923b  APP_LAUNCHSTATION-DS.zip\n2ce05514402d1f64024f18bb7a898f7208a8d676713541f634c0caabba6568fc  APP_LAUNCHSTATION-DS.psu\n```\n\n</details>\n"
