+        "body": "wLaunchELF R3Z v4.78 with the FTP server on. See the [README](https://github.com/oMrRexD/wLaunchELF_R3Z_FTP#readme) for what changes and how to use it.\n\n- `wLaunchELF_R3Z_FTP-R14.zip`: the `APPS/wLaunchELF-FTP/` folder, ready to copy to a memory card, SD2PSX card or USB drive. Edit `IPCONFIG.DAT` with the IP of your PS2 (`IP netmask gateway`).\n- `WLE-FTP.ELF`: the ELF alone.\n\nChanges from R13:\n- The version now shows the fork: `wLaunchELF v4.78_R3Z_FTP` in the title bar, the About screen and the build info.\n- A refused command from the PC (invalid or unknown) shows its message right away; before, it only appeared on the next key press.\n\nTested on my console (SD2PSX + internal HDD with exFAT, LaunchELF set to English): the version name, a refused command, and the whole receive flow (switch to udpfs, server found, game already on the HDD, back to FTP) with its messages.\n\nBuilt with `ps2dev/ps2dev@sha256:8fba50ecc2229acd7f8da63d34302f12939b7d4fa6848dda1e6a0ce083321a11`:\n`make rebuild ETH=1 UDPFS=1 EXFAT=1 MMCE=1 MX4SIO=1 LCDVD=LATEST DVRP=1 XFROM=1 DS34=0`\n\nSHA-256 of `WLE-FTP.ELF`: `499e69f02ce18cc0f90bcd2b74a3dd654b5dc772aefc5421c56f9e242410b2e2`\n\n---\n\n**Português**\n\nwLaunchELF R3Z v4.78 com o servidor FTP ligado. O que muda e como usar está no [README em português](https://github.com/oMrRexD/wLaunchELF_R3Z_FTP/blob/ftp/.github/README.pt-BR.md).\n\n- `wLaunchELF_R3Z_FTP-R14.zip`: a pasta `APPS/wLaunchELF-FTP/`, pronta pra copiar pro memory card, pro cartão do SD2PSX ou pro pendrive. Edite o `IPCONFIG.DAT` com o IP do seu PS2 (`IP máscara gateway`).\n- `WLE-FTP.ELF`: só o ELF.\n\nMudanças desde a R13:\n- A versão agora mostra o fork: `wLaunchELF v4.78_R3Z_FTP` na barra de cima, na tela About e nas informações do build.\n- Um comando do PC recusado (inválido ou desconhecido) mostra a mensagem na hora; antes, ela só aparecia quando se apertava um botão.\n\nTestada no meu console (SD2PSX + HD interno com exFAT, LaunchELF em inglês): o nome da versão, um comando recusado e o fluxo inteiro do receber (troca pro udpfs, servidor encontrado, jogo que já estava no HD, volta pro FTP) com as mensagens.\n"
