+            "message": "RA: hash PS1 images for POPS (.VCD)\n\nraHashVcd reads a VCD the way rc_hash_psx reads a PS1 disc: skip the\n1 MiB POPS header, map 2048-byte offsets onto 2352-byte MODE2 sectors,\ntake BOOT from SYSTEM.CNF (PSX.EXE if there is none), size from the\nPS-X EXE header plus 2048, MD5 of name and bytes. Directory names now\ncompare case-insensitively, as rcheevos does for both consoles.\n\nNot called yet. Host test on Blade (USA): 3e64b72f..., RA game 14491.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
