+            "message": "RA: name the sector source instead of a sentinel fd and a flag\n\nread_at() took a file descriptor, with -100 standing for the drive and\na global flag switching it to VCD sectors around each call. It now\ntakes a struct ra_src with the descriptor and its kind. The PS1 code\nreads SYSTEM.CNF in one place for the list and for the hash.\n\nHost test: Blade.VCD 3e64b72f... (RA 14491) and Dynasty Warriors 2\n29e392c7... (RA 19047), both unchanged. cppcheck finds nothing in the\nchanged lines.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
