+            "message": "Keep the RA snapshot going when Mode 6 turns the IGR off\n\nRA_OnVblank ran only from the IGR's VBLANK_END handler, and Mode 6\nskips Install_IGR, so a game set to Mode 6 sent no telemetry at all.\nSly Cooper and the Thievius Raccoonus needs that mode: it takes the\nIGR's padOpen patch for tampering and hides collectibles (xerabora\nissue #15).\n\nUnder Mode 6 syshook now installs a handler that calls RA_OnVblank and\nnothing else: no IGR thread, no padOpen patch, no CreateThread/ExecPS2\nhooks. A reset asked for over the network has nothing to carry it out\nin that mode, so IGR_RequestReset drops it.\n\nBuilt, not run on hardware.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
