+      "body": "First published build of the SHELF UI for Open PS2 Loader.\n\n## Which file do I want?\n\n| Asset | For |\n|---|---|\n| `OPNPS2LD-MMCE.ELF` | **Most people.** Built from the MMCE fork; supports memory-card SD devices (SD2PSX, MemCard PRO2) |\n| `OPNPS2LD-mainline.ELF` | Mainline OPL only. **Has no MMCE support at all** — flashing this on an MMCE setup makes the memory-card SD disappear |\n\nPut the file wherever your chip already boots OPL from — usually\n`mc0:/OPL/OPNPS2LD.ELF`, or `mmce0:/APPS/OPNPS2LD.ELF` on an SD2PSX under FMCB.\nSee [docs/INSTALL.md](../blob/main/docs/INSTALL.md) and\n[docs/BOOTING.md](../blob/main/docs/BOOTING.md).\n\nSome tools (`tools/stage-device.sh`, `tools/sync-card.sh`) expect the MMCE build\nat `patches/build/OPNPS2LD-MMCE.ELF`; download it there if you use them.\n\n## What's in it\n\n- **SHELF** — a sidebar shell with Home, Library, Apps and Settings pages, drawn\n  over OPL rather than configured through it. Open it with **L3** from anywhere.\n- **Grid themes** — `ItemsList` lays out a real grid, `GameImage` can address a\n  slot other than the highlighted one, with two-axis navigation.\n- **Sort modes, recently-played, `MenuTabs`, play stats, texture-safety fixes.**\n- Builds with `IGS=1`, so **D-pad Up** takes an in-game screenshot where GSM is\n  enabled for that title.\n\n## Status, honestly\n\nSHELF has been run on real hardware and phase 4 was verified at 480p. Phase 8\n(game grouping) is not started. The standalone theme patches `01`–`03` compile\nclean with zero warnings and their effect is confirmed by diffing section sizes\nagainst an unpatched build, but they have not been booted in isolation.\n\n**Test on a setup you can recover.** On an FMCB setup the no-button boot path is\nyour fallback: it runs the ELF baked inside the card image, which nothing here\ntouches. If a build hangs, power-cycle without holding L1.\n\n## Verifying\n\nThese are LZMA-packed, so `strings` on them returns compressed noise and finds\nnone of the feature strings — that is expected and is not evidence of a bad\nbuild. Verify against `opl.elf` in a build tree instead.\n\n| Asset | Size | MD5 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `OPNPS2LD-MMCE.ELF` | 1,389,876 | `07f7fb7b2c0e56202054ca3bb02aa88a` |\n| `OPNPS2LD-mainline.ELF` | 1,363,860 | `6962fc05af24a31551864a2235bcedfc` |\n\nSource for these binaries is this repository: the patches in `patches/`, and the\nwhole-file copies in `patches/shelf/tree/` that patch 09 is regenerated from.\nGPL-3.0-or-later.\n"
