fix(autoload): skip USB and MX4SIO menu discovery settles ([dde966b9](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/commit/dde966b92ad11b1b38887df3648d6be56c89d080))\n\n[Full changelog](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/commits/0bd7da480fc012bb0ac2859566196ba7f3c9046d)\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Downloads</summary>\n\n- [RIPTOPL-v1.2.0-Beta-4127-Korium.zip](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/releases/download/rolling-korium/RIPTOPL-v1.2.0-Beta-4127-Korium.zip) — Full install: loader, artwork, PSU, POPStarter, Ember, Neutrino and companion-tool links.\n- [RIPTOPL.ELF](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/releases/download/rolling-korium/RIPTOPL.ELF) — Standard loader update; replace your existing ELF.\n- [APP_RIPTOPL.psu](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/releases/download/rolling-korium/APP_RIPTOPL.psu) — Standard app for memory-card import; app files only.\n- [RIPTOPL-DEBUG-v1.2.0-Beta-4127-Korium.zip](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/releases/download/rolling-korium/RIPTOPL-DEBUG-v1.2.0-Beta-4127-Korium.zip) — Debug loaders for troubleshooting.\n- [RIPTOPL-LANGS-v1.2.0-Beta-4127-Korium.zip](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/releases/download/rolling-korium/RIPTOPL-LANGS-v1.2.0-Beta-4127-Korium.zip) — Extra interface languages and fonts.\n- [RIPTOPL-VARIANTS-v1.2.0-Beta-4127-Korium.zip](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/releases/download/rolling-korium/RIPTOPL-VARIANTS-v1.2.0-Beta-4127-Korium.zip) — Alternative loaders with extra features, controller emulation and DualSense support.\n- [RIPTOPL-v1.2.0-Beta-4127-Korium-src.zip](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/Open-PS2-Loader/releases/download/rolling-korium/RIPTOPL-v1.2.0-Beta-4127-Korium-src.zip) — Source code snapshot.\n\n[Installation and guides](https://nathanneurotic.github.io/Open-PS2-Loader/)\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Credits</summary>\n\n- **[PS2-Servers](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic/PS2-Servers)** by **[Ripto](https://github.com/NathanNeurotic)**\n- **[udpfs-server](https://github.com/YouKnow-sys/udpfs-server)** by **[YouKnow-sys](https://github.com/YouKnow-sys)**\n- **[OrbitPS2 Manager](https://github.com/Luden02/OrbitPS2-Manager)** by **[Luden](https://github.com/Luden02)**\n- **[LUNA](https://github.com/dnunezx/LUNA)** by **[darkladark](https://github.com/dnunezx)**\n- **[RIPPS2](https://github.com/akilluminati47/RIPPS2)** by **Akilluminati47**\n- **[OPL PS1 AIO Converter GUI](https://github.com/shaanhomebrew-cloud/OPL-PS1-AIO-Converter-GUI)** by **[shaan](https://github.com/shaanhomebrew-cloud)**\n- **[xeRAbora](https://github.com/hacan359/xerabora)** by **[hacan359](https://github.com/hacan359)**\n- **[OPL HTTP PC server](https://github.com/Docmine17/Open-PS2-Loader-HTTP)** by **[Docmine17](https://github.com/Docmine17)**\n- **[PS2RD CHT Manager](https://github.com/TheRealNextria/PS2RD-CHT-Manager)** by **[TheRealNextria](https://github.com/TheRealNextria)**\n- **[Ember](https://github.com/Gageformer/Ember)** by **[Gageformer](https://github.com/Gageformer)** · [official releases](https://github.com/Gageformer/Ember/releases)\n- **[BDM-UDPFS Assault](https://github.com/Okeanos86/BDMAssault/releases)** by **[Okeanos](https://github.com/Okeanos86)**\n- **[POPStarter](https://www.psx-place.com/resources/popstarter.683/)** by **krHACKen**\n- **[ORBIT Neutrino RA runtime](https://github.com/danielnuld/ps2-launcher/releases/tag/v1.0.2)** by **[Daniel (danielnuld)](https://github.com/danielnuld)**\n- **[Neutrino](https://github.com/rickgaiser/neutrino)** by **[rickgaiser](https://github.com/rickgaiser)**\n- **[PSUManager](https://git.techwritescode.dev/techwritescode/PSUManager)** by **techwritescode**\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- Neutrino Included build: v1.8.0-61-g7be8de2 -->\n\n"
