+      "body": "## PS2 Manager 2.1.0\n\n### 🌍 Language\n* **Language picker** in Settings → Appearance: System, Italiano or English.\n* PS2 Manager asks to relaunch to apply it (**Relaunch Now** / **Later**) and reopens once it has really quit.\n\n### 📥 Install / Update\n```bash\nbrew install --cask gionnio/tap/ps2-manager\nbrew upgrade --cask ps2-manager\n```\n\nPS2 Manager is not signed with an Apple Developer ID. If macOS blocks the first launch, open System Settings → Privacy & Security and click **Open Anyway** (right-click → Open no longer works on macOS 15 or later).\n"
