+  {
+    "repo": "Irfanlesnar/PS2-Launcher",
+    "release": {
+      "tag": "v5.0.0",
+      "published": "2026-10-06T14:33:15Z",
+      "url": "https://github.com/Irfanlesnar/PS2-Launcher/releases/tag/v5.0.0",
+      "body": "<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"v5_release\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/981a624e-ab9c-450c-96cb-65e3e7d5c254\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## PS2 Launcher v5.0.0\r\n\r\nThis release brings major new storage features, expanded video mode support, better performance, and wider controller compatibility.\r\n\r\nIn this build I release 2 versions\r\n1. PS2-Launcher-v5.0.0.ELF\r\n2. PS2-Launcher-v5.0.0.Black.screen.fix.ELF\r\n\r\nThe launcher may show a black screen when launched from certain versions of uLaunchELF. If you encounter this issue, use **PS2-Launcher-5.0.0 (Black Screen Fix).ELF** instead.\r\n\r\n### What's New\r\n\r\n- **MMCE Support**\r\n  - Added support for MMCE storage.\r\n\r\n- **New Files Tab**\r\n  - Access and manage connected storage devices directly from PS2 Launcher.\r\n  - Copy and paste files\r\n  - Delete files\r\n  - Launch games\r\n  - Launch ELF files\r\n  - Manage files across supported storage devices\r\n\r\n- **Expanded In-Game Resolution Options**\r\n  - Added support for:\r\n    - NTSC\r\n    - NTSC Non-Interlaced\r\n    - PAL\r\n    - PAL Non-Interlaced\r\n    - PAL @ 60Hz\r\n    - PAL @ 60Hz Non-Interlaced\r\n    - PS1 NTSC – HDTV 480p @ 60Hz\r\n    - PS1 PAL – HDTV 576p @ 50Hz\r\n    - HDTV 480p @ 60Hz\r\n    - HDTV 576p @ 50Hz\r\n    - VGA 640×480p @ 60/72/75/85Hz\r\n    - VGA 640×960i @ 60Hz\r\n    - VGA 800×600p @ 56/60/72/75/85Hz\r\n    - VGA 1024×768p @ 60/70/75/85Hz\r\n    - VGA 1280×1024p @ 60/75Hz\r\n\r\n- **Faster and More Stable Apps Loading**\r\n  - Improved apps tab loading speed and overall stability.\r\n\r\n- **New Controller Support**\r\n  - Shanwan PS3 Clone Controller\r\n  - ANT Esports GP300 Pro V2 Wireless Controller\r\n  - Steam Controller 2026\r\n  - Xbox 360 controller\r\n  - Flydigi Apex Wireless controller\r\n\r\n- **Device Sorting**\r\n  - Added device sorting options to the Games tab.\r\n\r\n- **Improved SMB Settings**\r\n  - Added more IP address configuration options for SMB connections.\r\n\r\n- **IGR Path Setting**\r\n  - Added an IGR path option to the Settings page.\r\n  - IGR may not work correctly on some PS2 consoles or configurations.\r\n\r\n- **Connected Controller Count**\r\n  - The UI now shows the number of currently connected controllers.\r\n\r\n### Other Improvements\r\n\r\nVarious internal improvements were also made to improve launcher responsiveness, stability, and overall usability.\r\n\r\nFeedback and bug reports are welcome."
