+      "body": "# What’s New\r\n\r\n## Highlights\r\n\r\n- **ZSO support** — compressed games are here! ([OPL 1.2.0 Beta](https://www.psx-place.com/threads/testers-needed-open-ps2-loader-with-zso-support-compressed-iso.37223/)) #34\r\n- **VMC write support**\r\n- **Cheats support** #29, including auto-download of widescreen cheats from [OPL-Widescreen-Cheats](https://github.com/PS2-Widescreen/OPL-Widescreen-Cheats)\r\n- **Dual-layer DVD support** #15\r\n- **Local collection config** (`oplpctools.ini`) — stores the OPL version and VMC encodings per collection\r\n- Official **Linux AppImage** build\r\n\r\n## Games & Installation\r\n\r\n- ZSO support:\r\n  - ZSO files are shown in the game list\r\n  - Install games from ZSO sources or convert existing games to ZSO\r\n- New game format converter, plus ISO restoration from ZSO\r\n- OPL 1.0 config fields are now supported: title, description, genre, developer, release date\r\n- New option to skip game validation on startup (workaround for English-patched ISOs) #39\r\n- Download cover art for all games at once #30\r\n- New `oplpctools.ini` local config for the collection (OPL version, VMC encodings). Can be disabled in the program settings.\r\n\r\n## VMC\r\n\r\n- Write to VMC\r\n- Improved export of individual folders and files from VMC\r\n- Configurable file name encoding for VMC\r\n\r\n## Linux\r\n\r\n- Official AppImage build\r\n- Patched Qt to fix the window icon in KDE Plasma 6 (KWin) on Wayland\r\n- Fixed the `.desktop` file for paths containing spaces #37\r\n\r\n## Breaking changes\r\n\r\n- **Windows XP support has been discontinued.** Maintaining compatibility with C++11, Qt 5.6.3, and the old MinGW toolchain has become increasingly difficult, so XP builds are no longer sustainable.\r\n- **Portuguese localization removed** because I lost contact with the translator."
